Cephes (src/lib2.cpp)
---------------------

The coefficients and Chebyshev series of i0 (the modified Bessel function of
order zero) are, as NumPy's (numpy/lib/_function_base_impl.py), from the
Cephes Math Library by Stephen L. Moshier.


